<title>MOROCCO: Morocco tourism earnings up 21.6 pct through Aug.</title>
<headline>Morocco tourism earnings up 21.6 pct through Aug.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's earnings from tourism rose by 21.6 percent to 8.016 billion dirhams ($921 million) during the first eight months of 1996, the Statistics Directorate said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in the same period last year, tourism earnings were 6.593 billion dirhams ($757 million).</p>
<p>A total of 1.151 million tourists visited Morocco between January-August this year, up 11 percent on the 1.037 million who visited in the 1995 eight-month period.</p>
</text>
